      "id": "fcaac8aff1c84458bf107"
    },
    {
      "text": "\nThe list of joins provided by Spark SQL is:\n\n1. Inner Join\n2. Left / Left Outer Join\n3. Right / Right Outer Join\n4. Outer / Full Join\n5. Cross Join\n6. Left Anti Join\n7. Left Semi Join\n8. Self Join\n\n```Syntax\n\n1) join(right: Dataset[_]): DataFrame\n2) join(right: Dataset[_], usingColumn: String): DataFrame\n3) join(right: Dataset[_], usingColumns: Seq[String]): DataFrame\n4) join(right: Dataset[_], usingColumns: Seq[String], joinType: String): DataFrame\n5) join(right: Dataset[_], joinExprs: Column): DataFrame\n6) join(right: Dataset[_], joinExprs: Column, joinType: String): DataFrame\n\n```",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionKey": "TAB",
          "completionSupport": true
        }
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "id": "94eb3b427def407f85f75"
    },
    {
      "text": "%spark\nval person = Seq(\n(0, \"Bill Chambers\", 0, Seq(100)),\n(1, \"Matei Zaharia\", 1, Seq(500, 250, 100)),\n(2, \"Michael Armbrust\", 1, Seq(250, 100)))\n.toDF(\"id\", \"name\", \"graduate_program\", \"spark_status\")\n\nval graduateProgram = Seq(\n(0, \"Masters\", \"School of Information\", \"UC Berkeley\"),\n(2, \"Masters\", \"EECS\", \"UC Berkeley\"),\n(1, \"Ph.D.\", \"EECS\", \"UC Berkeley\"))\n.toDF(\"id\", \"degree\", \"department\", \"school\")\n\nval sparkStatus = Seq(\n(500, \"Vice President\"),\n(250, \"PMC Member\"),\n(100, \"Contributor\"))\n.toDF(\"id\", \"status\")",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/scala",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "scala",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionKey": "TAB",
          "completionSupport": true
        }
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "id": "b78169d3037144739873f"
    },
    {
      "text": "%spark\nempDF.crossJoin(deptDF)\n    .show()",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/scala",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "scala",
